 O-REPLAY's analytic count"}, "OBS-WORK": {"fields": ["operation", "engineWorkUnits {rowsScanned, rowsWritten, triplesTouched, bytesWritten}", "source"], "verdict": "ratio of work units between the compared operations, evaluated against the named witness threshold"}, "OBS-MAINTENANCE": {"fields": ["kind", "tStart", "tEnd", "lagSamples"], "verdict": "events present; lag statistics against the named threshold"}, "OBS-ERASURE-SCAN": {"fields": ["inventoryEntry", "location", "scanMethod", "plaintextHits", "derivedChannelHits", "keyDestroyedEvidence", "tScan"], "verdict": "PASS iff every PROTECTED_COPY_INVENTORY location of the lane is scanned after the erasure published and shows zero plaintext and zero derived-channel hits, or every surviving copy there is shown to be encrypted only under the destroyed per-subject key (key exclusivity, RULINGS Q31f)"}, "OBS-WATERMARK": {"fields": ["readId", "basisPosition", "servingIndex", "watermarkAtRead", "waitMs", "route", "fallbackIndex"], "verdict": "PASS iff no read was answered by an index that was not eligible (COMPOSITION eligibility: watermark in the basis epoch, C1, reconstructability, erasure frontier), every wait before routing is within T-WATERMARK-WAIT-MS, every route and its surface language is recorded, and the fallback latency is inside the read's measured latency"}, "OBS-ACK-ORDER": {"fields": ["commitPosition", "tSourcePublished", "tAck", "ackSender", "ryowPullRoute"], "verdict": "PASS iff the source of truth sent every ACK, tAck >= tSourcePublished for every commit, and every pull at a returned position was served by an eligible index or the fallback"}, "OBS-FAULT-TRANSITIONS": {"fields": ["transition", "t", "durableEvidenceObject"], "verdict": "the last witnessed transition is the last one whose durable evidence is present after the crash"}}

