   551	### 5.5 Validity classes
   552	
   553	**VC** (calibration evidence; depends on nothing).
   554	- VC1 runKind = calibration; create-only; its timestamp precedes every acceptance receipt that cites it
   555	- VC2 binds the control profile identity and the load-contract or threshold registry hash
   556	- VC3 every value is the registry value or tighter, or UNATTAINABLE with its retained measurement
   557	- VC4 every ladder step's raw objects are retained
   558	- VC5 preconditions that are acceptance obligations (for the NS calibration: S.population.year-one for the engine) are evaluated by the VA rules on the control profile; they never depend on VC records
   559	
   560	**VA** (primary acceptance evidence; depends on VC).
   561	- VA1 produced by lab/bin in this repository, append-only, every evidence object present under runs/objects with matching sha256
   562	- VA2 profile identity complete and equal to the candidate profile
   563	- VA3 build first: imported dist hashes produced in this run
   564	- VA4 engine image digest equals the pin or a repaired image declared in this contract version
   565	- VA5 endpoint contacted equals the slot's; never 15442, 17019 or a homebase host
   566	- VA6 contract transitive hash, obligation definition hash, oracle files and case manifests equal the pinned values; every oracle used is ACCEPTED
   567	- VA7 fixture content hash and a fresh scope recorded
   568	- VA8 executed set equals the resolved selection x modes; skipped, unsupported, not-implemented all 0
   569	- VA9 language trace pure for lane receipts; host steps only HS-NORMALIZE and HS-FRONTIER
   570	- VA10 resource admission recorded; not BLOCKED_CAPACITY
   571	- VA11 every threshold used is the registry value or comes from a VC-valid calibration record cited in calibrationRefs
   572	- VA12 no failed acceptance receipt exists for the same obligation, scope key and profile; first failures retained
   573	- VA13 named DIAGNOSTICS executed and retained
   574	- VA14 composition bound: the four assignments with image digest, configuration hash and slot each, every replication edge, and the serving index's watermark at every read; engine-scope keys derived from the assignment (RULINGS Q28)
   575	- VA15 for NS and GS receipts: the trace generator source hash and seed equal the frozen pair of load-contract.json; background and overlay commands accounted separately; the driver-recorded requested basis present for every read
   576	- VA16 the profile is not a screening profile (SCREENING_PROFILES)
   577	
